{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":27,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4.n4_full_identity","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4.n4_full_identity","kind":"theorem","line":191,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/MolienJonesMarkovN4.lean#L191-L215","doc":"**(CAPSTONE) The S₄ Molien-predicted weights ARE the Jones–Markov weights.**\nThe four ratio identities pin `y_λ^Molien/y_(2,2)^Molien = ŝ_λ/ŝ_(2,2)` (the\nindependent Wenzl Schur-principal ratios), and the Markov normalisation pins the\noverall scale — so `y_λ^Molien = y_λ^Wenzl = y_λ^Jones-Markov`. Also records the\nconvention-D two-row cap. This is the **full** `n = 4` identity. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4.n4_two_row_cap_at_zD","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4.n4_two_row_cap_at_zD","kind":"theorem","line":181,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/MolienJonesMarkovN4.lean#L181-L189","doc":"**(COROLLARY) At the convention-D Markov parameter the `≥3`-row weights\nvanish.** For any `q,z` with `(q²+1)·z = q³` (i.e. `z = z_D`), both\n`num_(2,1,1)` and `num_(1⁴)` are `0` — the two-row Wenzl cap. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4.n4_rowcap_oneFour","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4.n4_rowcap_oneFour","kind":"theorem","line":173,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/MolienJonesMarkovN4.lean#L173-L179","doc":"**`num_(1⁴)` is divisible by `(q²+1)z − q³`**. Hence `y_(1⁴)` vanishes at\n`z_D = q³/(q²+1)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4.n4_rowcap_twoOneOne","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4.n4_rowcap_twoOneOne","kind":"theorem","line":166,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/MolienJonesMarkovN4.lean#L166-L171","doc":"**`num_(2,1,1)` is divisible by `(q²+1)z − q³`**: `num = ((q²+1)z−q³)·Q`.\nHence `y_(2,1,1)` vanishes at the convention-D Markov parameter `z_D = q³/(q²+1)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4.n4_markov_normalisation","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4.n4_markov_normalisation","kind":"theorem","line":149,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/MolienJonesMarkovN4.lean#L149-L162","doc":"**Markov normalisation for the S₄ Molien-predicted weights**, cleared to a\npolynomial identity: with `f^λ = 1,3,2,3,1`,\n\n  `(num₄+num₁⁴)·denₐ·den_b + 3(num₃₁+num₂₁₁)·den₁₂·den_b + 2·num₂₂·den₁₂·denₐ\n     = den₁₂·denₐ·den_b`,\n\ni.e. `Σ_λ f^λ y_λ = 1`. Pure `ring`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4.n4_wenzl_ratio_oneFour","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4.n4_wenzl_ratio_oneFour","kind":"theorem","line":140,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/MolienJonesMarkovN4.lean#L140-L145","doc":"`y_(1⁴)/y_(2,2) = ŝ_(1⁴)/ŝ_(2,2)` (cleared). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4.n4_wenzl_ratio_twoOneOne","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4.n4_wenzl_ratio_twoOneOne","kind":"theorem","line":133,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/MolienJonesMarkovN4.lean#L133-L138","doc":"`y_(2,1,1)/y_(2,2) = ŝ_(2,1,1)/ŝ_(2,2)` (cleared). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4.n4_wenzl_ratio_threeOne","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4.n4_wenzl_ratio_threeOne","kind":"theorem","line":126,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/MolienJonesMarkovN4.lean#L126-L131","doc":"`y_(3,1)/y_(2,2) = ŝ_(3,1)/ŝ_(2,2)` (cleared). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4.n4_wenzl_ratio_four","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4.n4_wenzl_ratio_four","kind":"theorem","line":119,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/MolienJonesMarkovN4.lean#L119-L124","doc":"`y_(4)/y_(2,2) = ŝ_(4)/ŝ_(2,2)` (cleared). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4.sHatDenOneFour","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4.sHatDenOneFour","kind":"def","line":103,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/MolienJonesMarkovN4.lean#L103-L104","doc":"`ŝDen_(1⁴)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4.sHatDenTwoOneOne","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4.sHatDenTwoOneOne","kind":"def","line":101,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/MolienJonesMarkovN4.lean#L101-L102","doc":"`ŝDen_(2,1,1)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4.sHatDenTwoTwo","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4.sHatDenTwoTwo","kind":"def","line":99,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/MolienJonesMarkovN4.lean#L99-L100","doc":"`ŝDen_(2,2)` (reference). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4.sHatDenThreeOne","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4.sHatDenThreeOne","kind":"def","line":97,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/MolienJonesMarkovN4.lean#L97-L98","doc":"`ŝDen_(3,1)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4.sHatDenFour","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4.sHatDenFour","kind":"def","line":95,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/MolienJonesMarkovN4.lean#L95-L96","doc":"`ŝDen_(4)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4.sHatNumOneFour","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4.sHatNumOneFour","kind":"def","line":92,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/MolienJonesMarkovN4.lean#L92-L93","doc":"`ŝNum_(1⁴)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4.sHatNumTwoOneOne","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4.sHatNumTwoOneOne","kind":"def","line":90,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/MolienJonesMarkovN4.lean#L90-L91","doc":"`ŝNum_(2,1,1)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4.sHatNumTwoTwo","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4.sHatNumTwoTwo","kind":"def","line":88,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/MolienJonesMarkovN4.lean#L88-L89","doc":"`ŝNum_(2,2)` (reference). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4.sHatNumThreeOne","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4.sHatNumThreeOne","kind":"def","line":86,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/MolienJonesMarkovN4.lean#L86-L87","doc":"`ŝNum_(3,1)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4.sHatNumFour","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4.sHatNumFour","kind":"def","line":84,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/MolienJonesMarkovN4.lean#L84-L85","doc":"`ŝNum_(4)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4.denEightB","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4.denEightB","kind":"def","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/MolienJonesMarkovN4.lean#L69-L70","doc":"Denominator of `y_(2,2)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4.denEightA","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4.denEightA","kind":"def","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/MolienJonesMarkovN4.lean#L67-L68","doc":"Denominator of `y_(3,1)` and `y_(2,1,1)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4.denTwelve","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4.denTwelve","kind":"def","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/MolienJonesMarkovN4.lean#L65-L66","doc":"Denominator of `y_(4)` and `y_(1⁴)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4.numOneFour","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4.numOneFour","kind":"def","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/MolienJonesMarkovN4.lean#L61-L63","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4.numTwoOneOne","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4.numTwoOneOne","kind":"def","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/MolienJonesMarkovN4.lean#L59-L60","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4.numTwoTwo","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4.numTwoTwo","kind":"def","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/MolienJonesMarkovN4.lean#L57-L58","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4.numThreeOne","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4.numThreeOne","kind":"def","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/MolienJonesMarkovN4.lean#L55-L56","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4.numFour","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.MolienJonesMarkovN4.numFour","kind":"def","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/MolienJonesMarkovN4.lean#L52-L54","signatureChunk":0}]}